    <item>
      <title>海底捞停止携宠就餐试点</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2253496</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2253496</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 04:40:04 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/8/e/8/8e89b208b38e63e65128fbddabb791abb80b1f39.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/kkWOl4LIQBQoz3vzMGFtDXeKPJT.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;海底捞停止携宠就餐试点 小狗上桌吃蛋糕惹社会争议&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/e/8/8e89b208b38e63e65128fbddabb791abb80b1f39_2_690x388.png&quot; alt=&quot;海底捞停止携宠就餐试点 小狗上桌吃蛋糕惹社会争议&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;kkWOl4LIQBQoz3vzMGFtDXeKPJT&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;388&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/e/8/8e89b208b38e63e65128fbddabb791abb80b1f39_2_690x388.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/8/e/8/8e89b208b38e63e65128fbddabb791abb80b1f39.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/8/e/8/8e89b208b38e63e65128fbddabb791abb80b1f39.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;9A8077&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;近期多地接连曝出有顾客私自使用餐厅公共餐具喂宠物的争议事件，也有顾客直接让自家宠物坐到专门给孩童准备的儿童椅上。早前尝试推进宠物友好服务的内地连锁火锅店海底捞昨日发布声明，主动叫停相关试点项目。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/3/1/1/3111b3d77e6d0e08db2fb4bb7ac64e165b974eca.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/705k3wFFTnSZIYdpsasbsXZMgWe.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;海底捞声明。&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/1/1/3111b3d77e6d0e08db2fb4bb7ac64e165b974eca_2_241x500.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;海底捞声明。&quot; title=&quot;海底捞声明。&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;705k3wFFTnSZIYdpsasbsXZMgWe&quot; width=&quot;241&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/1/1/3111b3d77e6d0e08db2fb4bb7ac64e165b974eca_2_241x500.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/1/1/3111b3d77e6d0e08db2fb4bb7ac64e165b974eca_2_361x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/1/1/3111b3d77e6d0e08db2fb4bb7ac64e165b974eca_2_482x1000.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;E7CFD0&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.stheadline.com/zh-hans/loadnext/0/3576640&quot; class=&quot;onebox&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://www.stheadline.com/zh-hans/loadnext/0/3576640&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
