&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://edition.cnn.com/2026/05/26/us/washington-paper-packing-plant-implosion&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;At least 1 dead and 9 missing after a chemical tank rupture at a paper and...&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;p&gt;At least one person has died, nine people were injured and nine employees remain unaccounted for after a large vat of chemical treatment product, including hazardous materials, ruptured at a paper and packaging facility in Washington state, fire...&lt;/p&gt;


  &lt;/article&gt;

